WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.865
From Indian farms to your door. Welcome
to Mazzev.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.020
Our products grow on farms across India,
and travel all the way to Europe.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.940
Step one. Farmers harvest fresh crops by
hand.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.500
Step two. The crops are processed and
packed in clean factories.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.700
Step three. Every batch is tested in the
lab for quality.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.900
Step four. Products are exported by sea
and by air.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:33.100
Step five. The goods are cleared by
European customs.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.300
Step six. You pay securely with
encrypted payment.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.465
Step seven. Your order is delivered
right to your door.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:47.000
Original products, on-time delivery.
Mazzev, wellness rooted in India.
